 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Mobile Page Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a mobile landing page?\", \"a\": \"A mobile landing page is a standalone page planned for visitors on phones, with one action to take: call, sign up, or buy. It loads quickly on a cellular connection and keeps its main button within reach of a thumb.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you design a mobile landing page?\", \"a\": \"Good mobile landing page design starts at the smallest screen: a single column with the main button low on the screen. The desktop layout comes second. With Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder'>AI landing page builder</a>, you describe the page and its action in a prompt and get the layout with a table behind it for every response.\"}, {\"q\": \"What do the best mobile landing pages include?\", \"a\": \"The best mobile landing pages ask for one thing and make it doable with a thumb. The headline and the button fit on the first screen, and the form stops at two or three fields. After submitting, the visitor lands on a thank you page that says what happens next.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find good mobile landing page examples?\", \"a\": \"Galleries from landing page builders and design sites collect mobile landing page examples by industry. Open each one on your own phone instead of reading a desktop screenshot, and note where the button sits. Pages with a single date and a short sign-up, such as an <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/event-landing-page'>event landing page</a>, show the pattern well.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is the difference between a responsive landing page and a mobile landing page?\", \"a\": \"The two overlap, but they start from different places. A responsive landing page adapts one layout to any screen width. A mobile landing page is planned for the phone first, with the button low and the form short. The strongest pages are both.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is a mobile landing page template worth using?\", \"a\": \"It saves layout work, because a mobile landing page template already stacks on small screens. Writing the offer and connecting the tracking are still on you. Emergent starts from a prompt that names your offer and the action you want, and builds the page around them.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should responsive landing page templates include?\", \"a\": \"Look for responsive landing page templates with a viewport meta tag, one column on phones, tap targets of at least 48 pixels, and phone fields set to type=tel. Then open the template on a real phone, because a desktop preview hides cramped buttons.\"}, {\"q\": \"How does responsive web design work on a landing page?\", \"a\": \"Responsive web design pairs a viewport meta tag with CSS media queries that change the layout at widths you choose. On a landing page that means a single column on phones and larger buttons. A <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/pricing-page'>pricing page</a> needs it most, because a four-column plan table cannot fit a phone screen.\"}, {\"q\": \"Does a responsive design landing page need a separate mobile URL?\", \"a\": \"No. A responsive design landing page serves the same address and the same HTML to every device, and CSS handles the layout. Google indexes the mobile version of a page's content, and one URL keeps that version identical to the desktop one. An ad and a text message can share the link.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you make mobile landing pages load fast?\", \"a\": \"Google counts a Largest Contentful Paint of 2.5 seconds or less as good, measured across real visits. On mobile landing pages the largest element is often the hero image, which makes it the first thing to shrink. The page Emergent builds logs every visit in a database you own, ready for a before-and-after comparison when you change the hero.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
